@startuml
title Domain Model Excerpt — US031 (User Registration)

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<AggregateRoot>> #D0C8F8
    BorderColor<<AggregateRoot>> #534AB7
    BackgroundColor<<ValueObject>> #FAE8C0
    BorderColor<<ValueObject>> #854F0B
}

package "User Management Aggregate" {
    class User <<AggregateRoot>> {
        + email : EmailAddress
        + name : String
        + phoneNumber : String
        + staffNumber : String
        + password : String
        + active : boolean
        + admin : boolean
        + role : String
        + securityClearanceExpiry : LocalDate
        + nextSkillsAssessmentDate : LocalDate
    }

    class EmailAddress <<ValueObject>> {
        + address : String
    }

    User "1" *-- "1" EmailAddress
}

note right of User
  Invariants:
  - email must be unique and valid
  - email domain must be in ValidEmailDomains
  - name and phoneNumber cannot be blank
  - phoneNumber must be exactly 9 digits
  - staffNumber must be unique and not blank
  - password >= 4 characters
  - securityClearanceExpiry must be future
  - nextSkillsAssessmentDate = today + 5 years (auto)
  - new user is always active = true, admin = false
end note

@enduml
